  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nfor _ in range(int(input())):\r\n    ritk=int(input())\r\n    harn=3*ritk\r\n    a=sorted(map(int,input().split()),reverse=True)\r\n    pooja=[0]\r\n    for x in a: pooja.append(pooja[-1]+x)\r\n    b=ritk\r\n    sanh=0\r\n    for A in range(ritk+1):\r\n        b=min(b,ritk-A)\r\n        while b and a[A+2*b-2]+a[A+2*b-1]<3*a[harn-2*A-b]:\r\n            b-=1\r\n        P=harn-2*A-b\r\n        sanh=max(sanh,3*pooja[P]+2*pooja[A]+pooja[A+2*b])\r\n    print(sanh)\r\n    ",
